 326+ B04E              ; ================================================================
 327+ B04E              ; view_select_plugin: pick the viewer plugin for the file under the
 328+ B04E              ; cursor from its extension. Carry set = nothing here can show it.
 329+ B04E              ;
 330+ B04E              ; viewExtTable is scanned in order, so an extension that has to win over
 331+ B04E              ; a later one must come first. NXI is tested before the screen size
 332+ B04E              ; check, because a 6912 byte .nxi would otherwise look like a SCR dump.
 333+ B04E              ; ================================================================
