 992+ B4F9              ; ================================================================
 993+ B4F9              ; Streaming output. SERVICE_EXTRACT and SERVICE_EXTRACT_SEEK each
 994+ B4F9              ; create, fill and close a file in a single call, so a member can never
 995+ B4F9              ; be longer than the 16 bit count they take. These three split that
 996+ B4F9              ; apart, letting a plugin hand over a file of any length a piece at a
 997+ B4F9              ; time - the ZIP plugin inflates into a 32K window and flushes it as it
 998+ B4F9              ; fills. File 1 stays open between the calls; the source file a plugin
 999+ B4F9              ; reads with SERVICE_READ_AT uses file 0, so the two never collide.
