8647  E501              ; Blocking keyboard input for code running in MMU7.  The resident INKEY
8648  E501              ; cannot be used here: its retry path calls gettime, and gettime changes the
8649  E501              ; $C000-$FFFF mapping through $7FFD.  Require a full release both before and
8650  E501              ; after the key so the H used to open Help is not consumed by the dialog.
